      "text": {
        "en": "Pet owners consistently commend the quality, presentation, and creative decoration of the custom dog cakes and cupcakes. Reviewers highlight that items are baked fresh rather than frozen, featuring thoughtful details such as personalised names, tailored flavours, and mashed potato icing. Many customers order annually for pet birthdays."
