        "en": "Wholesome ingredients that dogs enjoy"
      },
      "text": {
        "en": "Reviewers frequently report that their dogs devour the cakes and treats with great enthusiasm. Multiple owners of pets with sensitive digestive systems appreciate the wholesome, natural recipes, including peanut butter, pumpkin, and carrot flavours that cause no stomach upset or adverse digestive reactions."
      }
    },
    {
