      "title": {
        "en": "Helpful and welcoming bakery team"
      },
      "text": {
        "en": "Clients describe baker Yolanda and the shop team as friendly, considerate, and accommodating with short-notice requests. Several customers note that staff prepared bespoke cakes on the same day when needed in an emergency, taking time to guide buyers through suitable flavours and pickup arrangements."
      }
    }
